{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夕方まで雑誌の撮影して、夜からはNHKの生放送に出演してきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見てくれたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送緊張しました〜〜〜！汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも良い経験ができたし、またこういう番組に出させてもらえるように頑張るゾッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカーの事をたくさん勉強させてもらったので、これからもっともっと知って日本を応援していきたいです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れ日本！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、今夜24時53分〜、渡辺麻友さん主演の『さばドル』私たちも出ているので是非見てね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆゆさんが乃木坂46に移籍？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、どうなるんだろうか…。。。\n見逃せないよー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜遅いから、起きてられない人は録画録画(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日更新するね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/27/dvc00032.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/27/dvc00599.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}